		{"id":"scl-footer","type":"text","text":"## ✅ PACKAGED ROUTE + SPORTSBOOK FRONTAGE PROOF\n🚶 Walk 5:07 • 🏃 Run 2:35 • 800 m • 11/11 checkpoints • returned home • blocking floor • Map Check 0/0\n🎟 Normal: exact canonical S1G1 preview remains read only\n🧪 H17 QA: either team • 10–100 by 10 • exact return • review → confirm • one pending request + one linked debit\n🔒 No score, result, lock, settlement, history, backend, real money, or brain change","x":0,"y":970,"width":1800,"height":230,"color":"3"}
